::ALG1_U02_L02_Quiz_Q01::
Question ID: ALG1_U02_L02_Q01
MLA Standard: No new primary MLA standard; prerequisite support.
Question:
Solve 2x + 5 = 17.
{
=A. x = 6#Correct. Subtract 5 to get 2x = 12, then divide by 2.
~B. x = 11#This subtracts only one number and does not follow both inverse steps.
~C. x = 12#This stops after subtracting 5 and does not divide by 2.
~D. x = 34#This multiplies instead of isolating x.
}


::ALG1_U02_L02_Quiz_Q02::
